{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50029","headline":"句 · 傅温","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜坠中天衣觉冷，月临虚牗纸偏明。\n春风暗翦庭前树，夜雨偷穿石上苔。\n曲水两行排鴈齿，斜桥一道蹈龙鳞。\n山深野客如禅客，夜久松声似雨声。\n花疑汉女啼妆泪，水似吴娃笑弄筝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"傅温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}